    <motivation>Scanning electron microscopy (SEM) images of porous anodized aluminum oxide (PAAO) samples. The samples were made by anodization of aluminum monocrystal in 0.3 mol/L oxalic acid at 40 V for: 3 min 16 s (AJ-1), 3 min 37 s (AJ-2), 4 min 8 s (AJ-3), 4 min 30 s (AJ-4), 4 min 57 s (AJ-5).

Data source: &lt;a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5905496"&gt;https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5905496&lt;/a&gt;

CC BY 4.0.</motivation>
